  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Revenue Administration and Revenue Policy - Cote d&apos;Ivoire</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OTA is assisting the Direction Gnrale des Impts in identifying risks and creating mitigations as part of a Compliance Improvement Plan; developing the expertise and capacity to effectively audit specialty sectors such as banks, telecommunications, and the cocoa industry; applying international taxation best practices in ensuring compliance of multinational companies regarding exchange of information, proper application of transfer pricing routines, and related compliance activities; improving the efficiency and fairness of the tax dispute resolution process.</narrative>
  </description>
